# Web専用の入力境界。APIのDocker contextを広げない。
**
!package.json
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!apps/
!apps/web/
!apps/web/package.json
!apps/web/next.config.ts
!apps/web/next-env.d.ts
!apps/web/tsconfig.json
!apps/web/app/
!apps/web/app/**
!apps/web/src/
!apps/web/src/**
!packages/
!packages/shared/
!packages/shared/package.json
!packages/shared/tsconfig.json
!packages/shared/src/
!packages/shared/src/**
# 許可したソース配下の秘密とローカル成果物も除外する。
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.harness
**/tests
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
